1
00:02:05,687 --> 00:02:14,827
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:16,266 --> 00:02:20,286
-What have you done, Osman Bey?
-I did what needed to be done.

3
00:02:20,948 --> 00:02:23,050
Killers.

4
00:02:23,217 --> 00:02:27,387
Not only your sons but also you are killers, Osman!

5
00:02:27,889 --> 00:02:30,257
You are all liars!

6
00:02:30,391 --> 00:02:33,260
You killed the judge to save your killer son!

7
00:02:33,494 --> 00:02:37,431
And you? To get my son killed.

8
00:02:38,032 --> 00:02:40,867
...you killed the real judge

9
00:02:41,602 --> 00:02:44,971
Tell me. Who planned this?

10
00:02:45,173 --> 00:02:49,342
Ibrahim Bey? Yakup Bey?

11
00:02:49,944 --> 00:02:53,413
Why would I kill Rukneddin who...

12
00:02:53,448 --> 00:02:57,250
...I especially demanded to rule the trial?

13
00:02:58,052 --> 00:03:01,588
Was this the easiest way
to kill my son, Ibrahim Bey?

14
00:03:01,689 --> 00:03:05,659
If I had found your son before the trial

15
00:03:05,893 --> 00:03:09,863
...I would have killed him myself! But...

16
00:03:10,064 --> 00:03:13,033
...I didn't want
things to end up here.

17
00:03:13,568 --> 00:03:16,136
I have nothing to do with the judge!

18
00:03:16,504 --> 00:03:21,141
It doesn't matter anymore. The killer has to die.

19
00:03:25,246 --> 00:03:28,482
Nobody can kill my son as long as I breathe.

20
00:03:30,551 --> 00:03:31,852
Attack!

21
00:04:24,906 --> 00:04:29,342
Come on. Come on.

22
00:04:52,166 --> 00:04:58,905
Look at that! Look at that! Look at that!

23
00:05:00,208 --> 00:05:03,810
Alps, stop!

24
00:05:11,686 --> 00:05:16,857
Look at the army of Allah on the ground!

25
00:05:36,577 --> 00:05:40,146
Holy Quran commands...

26
00:05:40,781 --> 00:05:45,018
"Believers fight for the cause of Allah,

27
00:05:45,453 --> 00:05:49,522
...whereas disbelievers
fight for the cause of the Devil.

28
00:05:51,092 --> 00:05:55,095
So fight against Satan's forces.

29
00:05:55,763 --> 00:06:01,167
Indeed, Satan's schemes are ever weak."

30
00:06:04,772 --> 00:06:07,173
Are you faiths...

31
00:06:07,341 --> 00:06:12,245
...weaker than Satan's schemes?
Why are you fighting each other?

32
00:06:15,750 --> 00:06:20,020
A dervish's hat is his shroud.

33
00:06:21,589 --> 00:06:27,160
I put it in front of you. If you are
insistent on shedding brother's blood

34
00:06:27,762 --> 00:06:30,764
..start with us first.

35
00:06:31,032 --> 00:06:34,134
Then you can bury me with my shroud.

36
00:06:34,702 --> 00:06:39,739
And then you'll have all the battlefield to fight.

37
00:06:40,574 --> 00:06:44,144
Neither Germiyans nor Candars...

38
00:06:44,312 --> 00:06:48,281
...would ever swing swords against a dervish.

39
00:06:50,851 --> 00:06:53,586
Put your swords down!

40
00:07:02,163 --> 00:07:05,265
You've come and saved the killers.

41
00:07:05,900 --> 00:07:09,736
Don't you have anything to tell them, Dervish?

42
00:07:10,371 --> 00:07:13,173
They killed my son!

43
00:07:13,374 --> 00:07:17,577
The reason has left. Anger has come instead.

44
00:07:18,512 --> 00:07:21,147
Anger has overwhelmed the mind.

45
00:07:22,450 --> 00:07:25,185
Sultan is the anger now.

46
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:28,989
It doesn't let you see the world.

47
00:07:30,725 --> 00:07:35,695
I know. Your heart is burning in flames.

48
00:07:38,566 --> 00:07:42,702
But your anger blinds you.

49
00:07:47,742 --> 00:07:50,977
If it's going to help the fire inside you,

50
00:07:51,145 --> 00:07:54,414
...start with me, Melike Hatun.

51
00:08:12,533 --> 00:08:17,504
Today, swords aren't going to be
put back in the sheaths. No peace.

52
00:08:17,772 --> 00:08:19,939
But only war.

53
00:08:21,375 --> 00:08:26,146
There will be a river of blood in the battlefield.

54
00:08:28,682 --> 00:08:31,785
Get ready.

55
00:08:32,086 --> 00:08:37,256
Today is the day to deserve
the bread in your stomachs!

56
00:08:37,625 --> 00:08:41,660
-Attack.
-This jackal intends to restart the fire.

57
00:08:41,828 --> 00:08:44,497
I've already given up on my life, brother.

58
00:08:44,665 --> 00:08:48,301
Even if I'm going to pass away
today, we have to stop them.

59
00:08:48,569 --> 00:08:49,903
Let's go.

60
00:08:50,171 --> 00:08:53,006
Allah is the greatest!

61
00:08:58,145 --> 00:08:59,646
Ulcay!

62
00:09:08,289 --> 00:09:10,256
No jackals will go...

63
00:09:10,391 --> 00:09:13,093
...beyond this place today!

64
00:09:13,327 --> 00:09:16,696
No brother's blood will be shed today!

65
00:09:18,032 --> 00:09:21,267
I am speaking words not to cut off heads...

66
00:09:21,569 --> 00:09:24,671
...but to stop the fight between brothers.

67
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:31,711
Now the great warriors shall speak.

68
00:09:33,781 --> 00:09:39,252
I have a life to sacrifice
and some words to be heard.

69
00:09:39,487 --> 00:09:43,389
Either you'll hear my words and stop...

70
00:09:43,824 --> 00:09:46,459
.or..

71
00:09:51,532 --> 00:09:53,900
Yunus Emre.

72
00:10:02,209 --> 00:10:03,343
Take this.

73
00:10:10,451 --> 00:10:12,652
Allah is my witness...

74
00:10:12,786 --> 00:10:16,589
...that we didn't draw our
swords to shed brother's blood.

75
00:10:16,824 --> 00:10:22,662
We drew ours swords to wake them
up from the sleep of unawareness.

76
00:10:25,332 --> 00:10:31,171
But if they listen to Sultan of the Words

77
00:10:32,139 --> 00:10:34,240
...then...

78
00:10:35,509 --> 00:10:38,912
...we'll put out swords back in the sheaths.

79
00:10:47,855 --> 00:10:52,025
Yunus Emre is speaking of the truth.

80
00:10:54,295 --> 00:11:00,867
Tugay, go tell Ulcay not to fight anymore.

81
00:11:04,538 --> 00:11:08,575
Finally you've come to reason, Ibrahim Bey.

82
00:11:08,943 --> 00:11:13,846
Osman Bey, we have always been reasonable.

83
00:11:14,081 --> 00:11:18,184
Your recklessness have made us end up here.

84
00:11:20,154 --> 00:11:24,424
For now, there will be no fighting!

85
00:11:31,966 --> 00:11:36,202
Alps, light the arrows.

86
00:11:38,739 --> 00:11:42,809
Neither fire nor swords...

87
00:11:43,210 --> 00:11:45,612
...can stop me today.

88
00:11:45,746 --> 00:11:47,647
-Alps!
-Attack!

89
00:11:47,648 --> 00:11:49,215
Stop!

90
00:11:51,952 --> 00:11:54,420
Ulcay!

91
00:11:58,192 --> 00:12:00,593
A single man, Ibrahim Bey's orders.

92
00:12:06,734 --> 00:12:10,370
Come on!

93
00:12:12,172 --> 00:12:16,009
May the skies be my witness..

94
00:12:17,344 --> 00:12:19,812
..I will strangle you in your sleep.

95
00:12:32,326 --> 00:12:35,862
Everything Yunus Emre says is true.

96
00:12:35,929 --> 00:12:37,897
We were telling you that as well.

97
00:12:38,299 --> 00:12:44,137
That is why we were avoiding conflict.

98
00:12:45,205 --> 00:12:48,741
The reason why we were holding back..

99
00:12:49,009 --> 00:12:53,646
-..is just that.
I do not believe you did these.

100
00:12:53,981 --> 00:12:59,986
Someone is tricking us.

101
00:13:02,923 --> 00:13:07,627
However, we will not fall for
it. We will solve this together.

102
00:13:07,695 --> 00:13:11,964
Will my son come back
after you solve it, Osman Bey?

103
00:13:12,232 --> 00:13:16,336
Your son's vengeance will be
taken when it is solved, Melike Hatun.

104
00:13:16,570 --> 00:13:19,772
You will stop attacking my son.

105
00:13:19,907 --> 00:13:22,508
Hatun!

106
00:13:26,547 --> 00:13:31,851
Enough of this.
This is not the time.

107
00:13:49,136 --> 00:13:51,504
If you want to see the truth..

108
00:13:51,672 --> 00:13:56,843
...the judge's grave is apparent.

109
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:10,690
Yunus Emre. Since you are
stopping the fight with your word..

110
00:14:11,658 --> 00:14:16,028
..since you put yourself in front
of the sword with your Dervishes..

111
00:14:16,430 --> 00:14:21,167
..then, you are the most qualified person..

112
00:14:21,301 --> 00:14:25,471
..to find my son's killer.

113
00:14:27,775 --> 00:14:31,911
Truth is like sun.

114
00:14:32,012 --> 00:14:35,782
After dark..

115
00:14:36,049 --> 00:14:40,353
..truth always makes itself apparent.

116
00:14:43,590 --> 00:14:47,059
If Beys see it fit..

117
00:14:47,194 --> 00:14:49,729
..I support it.

118
00:14:51,865 --> 00:14:57,403
However, Ulcay will be with you at all times.

119
00:15:06,713 --> 00:15:12,185
Then, there will be one person from each Beylik.

120
00:15:13,620 --> 00:15:16,456
Mehmed Bey..

121
00:15:19,393 --> 00:15:23,229
..and Orhan Bey will be with us as well.

122
00:15:25,165 --> 00:15:31,337
Wait for me at Kurtbogan tomorrow
truth will be revealed, if Allah permits.

123
00:16:02,703 --> 00:16:05,705
-My son.
-Mother.

124
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:08,574
-Are you alright?
-I am alright, thank Allah.

125
00:16:08,709 --> 00:16:14,547
Hug your son now, Bala.

126
00:16:15,249 --> 00:16:19,752
Dirt covers my son.

127
00:16:19,820 --> 00:16:24,522
However, you will go through what
I went through, a thousand times.

128
00:16:40,507 --> 00:16:43,309
I told you we will survive, my rose.

129
00:16:43,377 --> 00:16:46,646
You did, my Bey.

130
00:16:58,191 --> 00:17:00,226
My Bey.

131
00:17:01,128 --> 00:17:05,631
-Are you alright?
-I am alright, thanks to you.

132
00:17:11,305 --> 00:17:14,807
You are now engaged.

133
00:17:15,342 --> 00:17:20,313
Now, it is time for your wedding.
After we are done with these issues.

134
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:24,750
Then, we will make a grand wedding,
if Allah permits.

135
00:17:28,021 --> 00:17:31,090
If Allah permits, my Bey.

136
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:36,095
Come on then.

137
00:17:50,844 --> 00:17:55,281
This Dervish was not good for us, Ulcay.

138
00:17:56,416 --> 00:18:01,087
If the truth about the judge is
revealed, they will find us for sure.

139
00:18:02,589 --> 00:18:05,691
-What will we do?
-It does not matter if..

140
00:18:05,792 --> 00:18:08,060
..wolf's teeth is sharper than jackal.

141
00:18:08,261 --> 00:18:11,430
Jackal's mind will win him the fight always.

142
00:18:12,432 --> 00:18:14,967
I made my move.

143
00:18:32,853 --> 00:18:36,422
Drop that sword.

144
00:18:37,491 --> 00:18:40,026
Commander of Bursa, Alexios.

145
00:18:40,193 --> 00:18:42,561
..is our friend.

146
00:18:45,132 --> 00:18:50,536
If you want live a long life, listen to Ulcay.

147
00:19:01,014 --> 00:19:05,685
-Did you bring Ahmed's killer?
-Bring him!

148
00:19:13,994 --> 00:19:20,366
Feodor. A prisoner sentenced to death.

149
00:19:20,934 --> 00:19:25,204
It does not matter who kills you, right Feodor?

150
00:19:25,672 --> 00:19:27,573
No.

151
00:19:33,914 --> 00:19:39,585
We gave his family a lot of gold for him.

152
00:19:40,954 --> 00:19:42,922
He will do what I say.

153
00:19:47,527 --> 00:19:50,496
The killer of Shahzade Ahmed.

154
00:19:50,864 --> 00:19:52,732
We will play a little game..

155
00:19:53,233 --> 00:19:56,569
..before you die.

156
00:19:58,071 --> 00:20:01,107
Take him.

157
00:20:07,147 --> 00:20:12,017
-Did you send word to Ibrahim Bey?
-He will have it soon.

158
00:20:13,086 --> 00:20:18,090
If he wants his son's
killer, he will come to Bursa.

159
00:20:18,291 --> 00:20:22,962
I will make the alliance we
talked about there as well.

160
00:20:23,263 --> 00:20:28,167
The alliance that will cost Osman his lands.

161
00:20:28,769 --> 00:20:33,539
Olcaytu Khan is after this issue.

162
00:20:33,673 --> 00:20:35,608
The Emperor..

163
00:20:35,742 --> 00:20:40,546
..wants Osman first, then
Yakup and Ibrahim to go away.

164
00:20:40,814 --> 00:20:43,482
Let us get rid of this issue first.

165
00:20:43,617 --> 00:20:47,253
Those upstairs will have what they want.

166
00:20:51,324 --> 00:20:55,127
You just take..

167
00:20:55,328 --> 00:21:01,066
..Ibrahim Bey in your hands.

168
00:21:04,971 --> 00:21:08,374
Alps. From now on, every night..

169
00:21:08,508 --> 00:21:14,413
..there will be communication between
all the alps guarding the perimeter.

170
00:21:14,514 --> 00:21:16,749
Especially in nights like these..

171
00:21:16,817 --> 00:21:21,320
..we will be extra cautious.

172
00:21:21,922 --> 00:21:24,790
Give it here, Hasan.

173
00:21:36,536 --> 00:21:39,471
In the name of Allah.

174
00:21:43,210 --> 00:21:48,013
When the long range arrows
arrive the alps on the other side..

175
00:21:48,081 --> 00:21:52,151
..they will answer.

176
00:22:02,495 --> 00:22:06,498
If they do not answer..

177
00:22:06,566 --> 00:22:11,503
Then we will know that,
there will be an attack on tribe.

178
00:22:13,607 --> 00:22:18,510
As you command, my Shahzade.
Do not worry, arrows will be shot.

179
00:22:18,712 --> 00:22:21,113
Thank you, come on.

180
00:22:38,498 --> 00:22:43,903
The existence of Holofira disturbs your peace.

181
00:23:01,087 --> 00:23:04,223
What's wrong with you, my
Hatun? Why don't you smile?

182
00:23:04,491 --> 00:23:08,360
Nothing, I'm all right.

183
00:23:12,065 --> 00:23:16,902
-Tell me.
-I feel an emptiness inside me.

184
00:23:18,872 --> 00:23:21,507
I wish it hadn't been like this.

185
00:23:23,209 --> 00:23:25,778
I wish.

186
00:23:27,547 --> 00:23:32,484
But it will get better. It'll all be all right.

187
00:23:34,821 --> 00:23:37,222
I hope so.

188
00:23:40,894 --> 00:23:44,630
Attention! Osman Bey!

189
00:23:46,299 --> 00:23:50,369
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too.

190
00:24:02,382 --> 00:24:07,086
Here, have a seat.

191
00:24:17,430 --> 00:24:21,133
After all those evil things...

192
00:24:21,234 --> 00:24:23,802
...thanks to my Creator...

193
00:24:23,903 --> 00:24:27,006
...we're together again.

194
00:24:30,243 --> 00:24:34,113
Despite all that lie, slander, envy

195
00:24:34,547 --> 00:24:39,585
and dishonor, the winner is love again.

196
00:24:47,460 --> 00:24:51,463
My son Alaeddin, my daughter-in-law Gonca.

197
00:24:51,865 --> 00:24:55,701
You followed the word of your ancestors.

198
00:24:56,069 --> 00:25:00,005
You've been loyal to our customs.

199
00:25:00,507 --> 00:25:03,609
And you've always gone after your love.

200
00:25:04,778 --> 00:25:08,580
I'm happy with you as your father.

201
00:25:09,082 --> 00:25:12,351
-Thank you, my Bey.
-Thank you, my Bey.

202
00:25:14,187 --> 00:25:19,725
If Allah permits, soon we will

203
00:25:19,859 --> 00:25:22,961
-reveal your innocence.
-If Allah permits.

204
00:25:23,096 --> 00:25:26,698
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-After that,

205
00:25:26,766 --> 00:25:29,268
we will make the most glorious ceremony.

206
00:25:29,369 --> 00:25:32,004
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

207
00:25:32,105 --> 00:25:36,608
Your family, your parents

208
00:25:37,577 --> 00:25:43,048
will understand this situation
and they will be with us.

209
00:25:43,183 --> 00:25:45,751
If Allah permits, my Bey.

210
00:25:49,189 --> 00:25:54,860
Tough paths cannot be
crossed with soft hearted ones.

211
00:25:55,628 --> 00:25:58,664
Holofira.

212
00:25:59,099 --> 00:26:01,867
You risked your own life

213
00:26:02,535 --> 00:26:07,306
and you did your best for me and for my children.

214
00:26:09,909 --> 00:26:13,846
Thank you. Thank you.

215
00:26:15,215 --> 00:26:17,950
From now on

216
00:26:18,451 --> 00:26:21,220
you are our daughter as well.

217
00:26:23,723 --> 00:26:27,326
Thank you, Osman Bey.

218
00:26:28,128 --> 00:26:30,562
I see you as a father.

219
00:26:34,968 --> 00:26:39,872
May my Creator make us the key
for blessing and lock for the evil.

220
00:26:40,006 --> 00:26:42,508
-Aameen.
-Aameen.

221
00:26:42,575 --> 00:26:45,777
May He always give us the
opportunity to live a day like this.

222
00:26:45,845 --> 00:26:48,547
If Allah permits.

223
00:26:49,282 --> 00:26:51,884
Come on now.

224
00:26:57,323 --> 00:27:00,312
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

225
00:27:00,312 --> 00:27:01,942
Thank you, my Bey.

226
00:27:07,133 --> 00:27:09,401
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate

227
00:27:20,380 --> 00:27:26,018
Understand the game well. You
are Cerkutay Bey, don't forget.

228
00:27:26,152 --> 00:27:29,621
No, it's wrong. Cerkutay Bey's heart is here.

229
00:27:29,789 --> 00:27:32,658
And you'll do this.

230
00:27:43,937 --> 00:27:47,206
Look at this.

231
00:27:48,775 --> 00:27:52,344
My Bey. Look,

232
00:27:52,745 --> 00:27:56,281
I've brought you bear grease
you can rub it on your beard.

233
00:27:56,883 --> 00:27:59,985
It will shine it and make it look better.

234
00:28:00,053 --> 00:28:05,190
Father, are you out of your mind?
This is goat hair, not a real beard.

235
00:28:05,625 --> 00:28:10,128
Thnak you, my Bey. Thank you.

236
00:28:10,630 --> 00:28:13,632
I didn't know that.

237
00:28:14,434 --> 00:28:18,103
Ghazi, look at me.

238
00:28:18,705 --> 00:28:21,773
Don't make me regret that I accepted it.

239
00:28:21,841 --> 00:28:24,843
You might say something wrong

240
00:28:25,011 --> 00:28:28,046
-It'd be a shame for Osman Bey.
-Father.

241
00:28:28,214 --> 00:28:32,150
Don't meddle in my business, don't hinder me.

242
00:28:32,218 --> 00:28:34,886
I'll be free, I'll get out

243
00:28:34,988 --> 00:28:37,789
and I'll say anything I want. That's enough!

244
00:28:38,057 --> 00:28:41,193
-Ghazi.
-No.

245
00:28:42,061 --> 00:28:45,697
No, Cerkutay Bey. Now get out of my sight!

246
00:28:46,165 --> 00:28:50,135
-Look what you're saying.
-Alps.

247
00:28:50,270 --> 00:28:52,304
Take this alp out of my tent.

248
00:28:52,372 --> 00:28:55,540
-Yes, my Bey.
-Stop.

249
00:28:56,242 --> 00:28:59,645
-Who's that?
-Baysungur Alp.

250
00:29:03,549 --> 00:29:07,619
-Who's he?
-It's you.

251
00:29:11,491 --> 00:29:15,360
-Is he me?
-Yes.

252
00:29:19,065 --> 00:29:23,535
Take a good care of your appearance.

253
00:29:24,504 --> 00:29:28,140
Your appearance is the most important thing.

254
00:29:30,810 --> 00:29:34,746
And don't embarrass your father.

255
00:29:34,847 --> 00:29:38,183
Come on, Cerkutay Bey. Come on.

256
00:29:38,384 --> 00:29:42,454
Yes, my Bey.

257
00:30:01,474 --> 00:30:05,410
Praise be.

258
00:30:12,418 --> 00:30:16,588
My Gonca. You don't eat anything.

259
00:30:16,889 --> 00:30:20,292
No, I'm eating, Alaeddin.

260
00:30:28,334 --> 00:30:31,336
Germiyanoglu Border - Frontier Market

261
00:31:08,141 --> 00:31:10,308
Oh, the smell of my daughter.

262
00:31:10,510 --> 00:31:13,545
What have you done?

263
00:31:14,013 --> 00:31:18,784
You disobeyed my orders! How
could you do this to me, daughter?

264
00:31:19,585 --> 00:31:23,221
What kind of test did you put me into?

265
00:31:27,427 --> 00:31:32,497
Would I ever put you in a caged tent?

266
00:31:38,471 --> 00:31:40,872
Don't do this, father.

267
00:31:44,410 --> 00:31:47,045
It's not your fault.

268
00:31:47,346 --> 00:31:50,849
Don't be upset.

269
00:31:53,419 --> 00:31:57,889
How can I not be upset? My Gonca

270
00:31:58,624 --> 00:32:02,160
my rose-scented daughter

271
00:32:02,462 --> 00:32:04,763
turned against her father.

272
00:32:07,166 --> 00:32:10,802
She said you're not my father anymore.

273
00:32:13,105 --> 00:32:15,740
It's not Gonca's fault as well.

274
00:32:17,210 --> 00:32:22,848
Alaeddin fooled her. The Kayis
have turned my sister against us.

275
00:32:24,183 --> 00:32:26,751
Osman.

276
00:32:33,059 --> 00:32:36,495
Osman will pay its price.

277
00:32:37,096 --> 00:32:39,931
He took my daughter.

278
00:32:40,166 --> 00:32:44,369
He destroyed my reputation.

279
00:32:45,371 --> 00:32:48,907
I'll make him pay for this.

280
00:33:16,369 --> 00:33:20,472
Attention!

281
00:33:24,644 --> 00:33:28,713
Osman Bey.

282
00:33:34,085 --> 00:33:37,121
What happened, Cerkutay?

283
00:33:39,225 --> 00:33:43,895
-Osman Bey.
-What Osman Bey?

284
00:33:57,710 --> 00:34:01,780
Peace be upon you.

285
00:34:10,489 --> 00:34:14,059
Ghazi...

286
00:34:14,594 --> 00:34:17,295
Peace be upon you too

287
00:34:27,306 --> 00:34:32,210
Infidels, our enemies surrounded us.

288
00:34:34,947 --> 00:34:37,748
Cerkutay!

289
00:34:38,150 --> 00:34:40,819
On the horizons of Sogut and Yenisehir...

290
00:34:41,187 --> 00:34:45,590
...signs have appeared.

291
00:34:46,592 --> 00:34:50,962
It seems that friends and enemies
will unite and come upon us.

292
00:34:51,130 --> 00:34:55,567
My Bey, there are a few of us,
how will we deal with these enemies?

293
00:34:55,668 --> 00:34:59,971
No! Don't!

294
00:35:00,272 --> 00:35:04,175
Don't, Cerkutay! Many times, the few...

295
00:35:04,243 --> 00:35:06,978
...have defeated the many.

296
00:35:07,213 --> 00:35:11,216
Oh Praise be! -Did my heart...

297
00:35:11,550 --> 00:35:15,186
...my effort, disappear that
they demand our lives from us?

298
00:35:15,287 --> 00:35:17,489
Oh praise be!

299
00:35:17,623 --> 00:35:20,692
Alps! Stand up and get ready!

300
00:35:20,926 --> 00:35:23,962
Draw your swords!

301
00:35:24,063 --> 00:35:27,332
I swear by the soul of my
ancestor Oghuz Khan that...

302
00:35:27,466 --> 00:35:31,970
...the days when we will stand at the
gates of Mekece castle and Bursa are near!

303
00:35:32,104 --> 00:35:36,574
-Allah is the Greatest!
-O Praise be!

304
00:35:37,943 --> 00:35:40,645
For the love of Ghazis who say Allah Allah!

305
00:35:40,746 --> 00:35:42,547
Allah is the Greatest!

306
00:35:42,548 --> 00:35:45,850
For the love of martyrs who
were martyred with bloody swords!

307
00:35:45,951 --> 00:35:47,786
Allah is the Greatest!

308
00:35:47,887 --> 00:35:51,923
For the love of mothers who are
waiting for victory and praying for us!

309
00:35:52,024 --> 00:35:54,325
Run to the infidels!

310
00:35:54,427 --> 00:35:56,161
Allah is the Greatest!

311
00:35:56,495 --> 00:36:01,032
Allah is the Greatest!
Allah is the Greatest!

312
00:36:04,270 --> 00:36:09,574
Allah is the Greatest! Praise be!

313
00:36:11,777 --> 00:36:15,180
Osman Bey...

314
00:36:20,186 --> 00:36:23,421
Come. -Come closer.

315
00:36:23,789 --> 00:36:26,658
Come here!

316
00:36:26,792 --> 00:36:29,094
Did you hear what he said?

317
00:36:30,129 --> 00:36:35,433
Osman Bey... Come here.

318
00:36:43,976 --> 00:36:47,779
Let me see your beard.

319
00:36:48,180 --> 00:36:52,951
Osman Bey... You made a beard out of goat hair.

320
00:36:53,619 --> 00:36:59,290
Where is your mouth?
-Here, my Bey.

321
00:37:04,430 --> 00:37:08,466
Look at his ring.

322
00:37:08,934 --> 00:37:12,537
Praise be, praise be!

323
00:37:13,939 --> 00:37:16,908
You did not get mad, right, my Osman Bey?
-No.

324
00:37:17,009 --> 00:37:21,746
Why would I? Why would I get mad?

325
00:37:22,014 --> 00:37:26,484
We don't just see you as children.

326
00:37:26,652 --> 00:37:32,457
Our fathers also raised us with the fire of gaza.

327
00:37:32,992 --> 00:37:38,062
Look... Now we have become a magnificent sycamore.

328
00:37:38,297 --> 00:37:41,633
If Allah permits, we will get even stronger.

329
00:37:41,700 --> 00:37:44,169
If Allah permits, my Bey.

330
00:37:44,470 --> 00:37:47,672
Orhan

331
00:37:47,907 --> 00:37:50,141
Alaeddin!

332
00:37:50,509 --> 00:37:54,946
Just like Ghazi and Osman Bey...

333
00:37:56,348 --> 00:38:00,218
...I want grandchildren from you...

334
00:38:00,386 --> 00:38:05,623
...who burn with the fire of gaza. Know that.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

335
00:38:16,068 --> 00:38:20,171
We will have grandchildren, Osman Bey. We will.

336
00:38:20,172 --> 00:38:24,142
And our glorious sycamore will
get bigger and stronger, if Allah permits.

337
00:38:24,210 --> 00:38:27,312
Our lineage will continue.

338
00:38:30,382 --> 00:38:34,686
Come on now, Osman Bey. Go to
your Alps. They are all waiting for you.

339
00:38:34,887 --> 00:38:38,423
You deserved a meal. Eat now.

340
00:38:38,524 --> 00:38:42,493
Yes my Osman Bey.

341
00:38:45,531 --> 00:38:47,765
Come on Alps.

342
00:38:58,777 --> 00:38:59,744
Beys.

343
00:39:03,382 --> 00:39:05,650
You will come with me.

344
00:39:24,069 --> 00:39:27,505
Gunduz Bey. No sooner than tomorrow...

345
00:39:27,773 --> 00:39:32,410
...you and Alaeddin will be at the place
where Mekece's preparations are made.

346
00:39:32,912 --> 00:39:36,281
-Okay, Osman Bey.
-Yes my Bey.

347
00:39:36,482 --> 00:39:39,651
Orhan. You will be with Mehmed..

348
00:39:39,752 --> 00:39:42,720
...and that jackal Olcay.

349
00:39:42,988 --> 00:39:45,189
You will watch the investigation that...

350
00:39:45,391 --> 00:39:49,027
...Yunus Emre will conduct.
-Yes my Bey.

351
00:39:49,695 --> 00:39:53,698
Everyone will be cautious. But Alaeddin...

352
00:39:53,766 --> 00:39:56,935
You will be even more careful.

353
00:39:57,736 --> 00:40:00,939
We couldn't prove your innocence.

354
00:40:01,540 --> 00:40:06,177
Gonca coming with us will drive Mehmet and...

355
00:40:06,378 --> 00:40:08,947
...Yakup crazy.

356
00:40:09,014 --> 00:40:12,583
They can make a move at any time.

357
00:40:12,651 --> 00:40:16,020
Don't worry, father. We will find
the killer as soon as possible...

358
00:40:16,088 --> 00:40:19,590
...and we will prove our innocence,
if Allah permits.

359
00:40:19,992 --> 00:40:21,993
If we cannot...

360
00:40:27,833 --> 00:40:31,569
...we cannot prevent people
from shedding brothers' blood.

361
00:40:32,171 --> 00:40:39,010
We prevented it today. But, we cannot
know what tomorrow is going to bring.

362
00:40:44,950 --> 00:40:47,652
Slit my throat, Ibrahim Bey.

363
00:40:47,753 --> 00:40:50,521
You set our son's killer free today...

364
00:40:50,622 --> 00:40:53,024
...send me to my son. Slit my throat!

365
00:40:53,092 --> 00:40:56,561
Hatun... Don't...
What should I do, Ibrahim Bey?

366
00:40:56,895 --> 00:40:59,464
Didn't Osman get away with what he did, huh?

367
00:40:59,565 --> 00:41:04,135
How could you do this to us?
-Hatun!

368
00:41:06,805 --> 00:41:11,976
Everyone on these lands believe
and trust the words of Yunus Emre.

369
00:41:12,044 --> 00:41:15,179
The man put his turban in front of us as a shroud!

370
00:41:15,247 --> 00:41:17,782
How could I stand against him?

371
00:41:19,018 --> 00:41:21,853
You should have stood against him as Ibrahim Bey.

372
00:41:22,021 --> 00:41:24,822
Let alone a Dervish, no matter who comes...

373
00:41:25,057 --> 00:41:28,059
...you should've stood against them -Hatun!

374
00:41:29,061 --> 00:41:34,098
You are making me and yourself commit sin.

375
00:41:34,666 --> 00:41:39,604
Yunus Emre stepped in. And I trust him.

376
00:41:39,738 --> 00:41:43,941
Don't worry. He will solve this issue.

377
00:41:44,610 --> 00:41:48,813
Osman Bey will organize a celebration
after our funeral and have a good time...

378
00:41:49,748 --> 00:41:52,984
...and we will wait. Is that true?

379
00:41:53,052 --> 00:41:55,453
Can I come in?

380
00:41:55,621 --> 00:41:58,022
Come in.

381
00:42:01,727 --> 00:42:04,862
Ibrahim Bey, this letter was sent to you.

382
00:42:15,507 --> 00:42:19,010
If you want to find your son's murderer...

383
00:42:19,311 --> 00:42:24,382
...we want to host you in Bursa castle.

384
00:42:25,350 --> 00:42:29,153
Bursa Commander Alexius.

385
00:42:33,092 --> 00:42:38,896
What does that Bursa's Commander Alexius...

386
00:42:39,298 --> 00:42:43,267
..know about our son's killer?

387
00:42:43,335 --> 00:42:45,736
You will go there, right my Bey?

388
00:43:59,044 --> 00:44:02,146
What is the cost of these?

389
00:44:02,748 --> 00:44:07,351
What is the cost of these? -It is a lifetime.

390
00:44:08,754 --> 00:44:11,522
A lifetime.

391
00:44:13,592 --> 00:44:18,296
A lifetime. A lifetime.

392
00:47:16,508 --> 00:47:19,110
I hope it's good!

393
00:47:21,246 --> 00:47:22,346
Bala.

394
00:47:32,124 --> 00:47:35,292
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

395
00:47:37,496 --> 00:47:40,431
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

396
00:48:18,336 --> 00:48:21,405
Allah is the greatest.

397
00:48:27,345 --> 00:48:34,752
Peace and mercy of Allah
shall be upon you.

398
00:49:20,332 --> 00:49:23,200
What's going on?

399
00:49:27,405 --> 00:49:31,942
-It's alright. It's alright.
-Cerkutay.

400
00:49:36,381 --> 00:49:40,084
Osman Bey... Where is he?

401
00:49:42,087 --> 00:49:45,022
I don't know, Bala Hatun.

402
00:49:46,591 --> 00:49:50,127
Oghuz. Alps.

403
00:49:50,562 --> 00:49:54,498
-Where is Osman Bey?
Since we stood watch here

404
00:49:54,733 --> 00:49:57,735
...nobody has come out, Bala Hatun.

405
00:49:59,604 --> 00:50:03,941
-You should stand watch properly!
-Calm down, Cerkutay.

406
00:50:04,442 --> 00:50:08,546
If he has a plan in his mind, no
watchmen can see Osman Bey.

407
00:50:10,215 --> 00:50:13,751
You're right, Bala Hatun.

408
00:50:14,619 --> 00:50:17,922
Mother Bala, is my father in the tent?

409
00:50:18,089 --> 00:50:23,093
No, son. It seems Osman Bey is looking for
new destinations to ride his horse towards.

410
00:50:24,563 --> 00:50:28,966
-Has he gone somewhere?
-They say nobody left the tent.

411
00:50:29,701 --> 00:50:34,338
-We don't know.
-I hope there isn't a problem.

412
00:50:34,806 --> 00:50:38,642
No problem. Osman Bey must have a plan.

413
00:50:38,843 --> 00:50:40,744
Everybody get back to work, come on.

414
00:50:40,745 --> 00:50:43,213
I'll go see Yunus Emre for the investigation.

415
00:50:43,381 --> 00:50:46,283
If you hear from my father, let me know, mother.

416
00:50:46,384 --> 00:50:48,586
Alright. Stay safe, son.

417
00:50:48,587 --> 00:50:50,654
Thank you.
Oghuz.

418
00:50:50,822 --> 00:50:53,691
-Prepare the horses.
-As you order, my Bey.

419
00:50:54,392 --> 00:50:57,561
-Come on, Cerkutay.
-Be careful.

420
00:51:06,004 --> 00:51:11,108
The dream you saw is adorned
with secrets, Osman Bey.

421
00:51:12,243 --> 00:51:16,246
Each of them is to be cut open.

422
00:51:18,183 --> 00:51:22,987
But the thing you saw is a covered fact.

423
00:51:23,321 --> 00:51:26,924
You're supposed to remove the cover.

424
00:51:29,060 --> 00:51:33,731
All that fog points out that.

425
00:51:37,168 --> 00:51:42,172
A fact hidden with a cover of evil.
-Well...

426
00:51:44,009 --> 00:51:49,313
The dream I saw... The ring in the fish's mouth...

427
00:51:49,814 --> 00:51:54,051
The smell on my hand... It's still here.

428
00:51:54,552 --> 00:51:57,721
It smells like the sea.

429
00:51:59,591 --> 00:52:03,160
Well... What does the mountain stand for?

430
00:52:04,429 --> 00:52:10,100
Both the fish and the ring point out the conquests.

431
00:52:10,702 --> 00:52:15,806
And what is blowing from Mount Kesis
towards you is the wind of conquests.

432
00:52:17,108 --> 00:52:21,378
Every wind awaits a flag, Osman Bey.

433
00:52:21,813 --> 00:52:26,417
And Mount Kesis misses the flag of Islam.

434
00:52:26,851 --> 00:52:29,987
It expects you to end this longing.

435
00:52:30,255 --> 00:52:33,057
It awaits the reunion.

436
00:52:33,725 --> 00:52:36,493
It awaits you.

437
00:52:50,108 --> 00:52:55,345
Then I need to fulfill the longing now.

438
00:52:58,016 --> 00:53:00,984
Have a safe journey.

439
00:53:03,822 --> 00:53:07,825
Thank you, thank you, Yunus Emre.

440
00:53:13,531 --> 00:53:17,101
Here we go.

441
00:55:06,511 --> 00:55:10,948
O Mount Kesis! The azan of Muhammad
(PBUH) will resound in your sky...

442
00:55:11,015 --> 00:55:14,351
...and many believers will worship at your feet.

443
00:55:14,752 --> 00:55:17,087
Sooner or later.

444
00:55:54,692 --> 00:55:56,528
Come! The best quality here!

445
00:55:56,540 --> 00:55:58,962
Nobody has better
goods than Hristo.

446
00:57:35,893 --> 00:57:38,528
Oh Bursa...

447
00:57:41,933 --> 00:57:45,502
What time are you waiting for?

448
00:57:48,272 --> 00:57:52,342
If we're looking for the truth,
we should want to find it first.

449
00:57:52,944 --> 00:57:56,213
And everybody who wants to find the truth...

450
00:57:56,881 --> 00:57:58,348
...is here.

451
00:57:58,416 --> 00:58:03,854
Let's find it and get rid of the
slander on my brother, Yunus Emre.

452
00:58:03,988 --> 00:58:06,990
The truth cannot be hidden, Orhan Bey.

453
00:58:07,091 --> 00:58:10,527
Slander can only hit the slanderer.

454
00:58:10,862 --> 00:58:14,097
-Don't be worrying.
-Okay.

455
00:58:16,634 --> 00:58:21,505
While looking for the killer, will we start
to look thinking Alaaddin is innocent?

456
00:58:22,707 --> 00:58:25,308
Didn't you start by blaming him...

457
00:58:25,343 --> 00:58:28,245
...while there was no evidence?

458
00:58:35,153 --> 00:58:37,888
Where should we start, Mehmed Bey?

459
00:58:38,256 --> 00:58:43,226
From where it started. From the frontier market.

460
00:58:43,394 --> 00:58:46,763
Didn't the frontier market
get investigated several times?

461
00:58:46,831 --> 00:58:49,833
Place isn't separated from time.

462
00:58:50,068 --> 00:58:53,737
What couldn't be seen then can be seen now.

463
00:58:54,105 --> 00:58:55,572
We'll start there.

464
00:58:55,606 --> 00:58:59,042
Whatever you command, Yunus Emre.

465
00:59:00,311 --> 00:59:05,482
But this time, Alaaddin Bey
and Gonca Hatun will be there.

466
00:59:06,217 --> 00:59:10,520
Because the matter might be twisted easily.

467
00:59:11,422 --> 00:59:14,024
They are banned to enter the frontier market.

468
00:59:14,225 --> 00:59:16,827
Sultan of the Words has spoken.

469
00:59:17,028 --> 00:59:20,030
We should speak no more, Mehmed Bey.

470
00:59:20,531 --> 00:59:23,166
Not at all, not at all.

471
00:59:23,301 --> 00:59:27,137
Everybody has words and should speak.

472
00:59:27,738 --> 00:59:30,340
So the truth can be revealed.

473
00:59:30,441 --> 00:59:34,911
For this reason, Alaaddin Bey
and Gonca Hatun will speak too.

474
00:59:36,914 --> 00:59:40,951
It's appropriate for them to be in
the market about the investigation.

475
00:59:43,020 --> 00:59:44,187
Alright.

476
00:59:46,290 --> 00:59:48,692
Let's go then.

477
00:59:48,726 --> 00:59:51,228
May Allah keep your journey safe.

478
00:59:51,362 --> 00:59:54,030
-Thank you.
-Thank you, Yunus Emre.

479
01:00:29,133 --> 01:00:31,868
God bless you.

480
01:00:45,149 --> 01:00:49,753
Thanks. I'm grateful to you, stranger.

481
01:00:50,254 --> 01:00:52,626
What are you looking for here?

482
01:00:52,638 --> 01:00:54,791
Do you know everyone here?

483
01:00:55,092 --> 01:00:57,527
You quickly realized I was a stranger.

484
01:00:57,728 --> 01:01:00,664
The people of this city can't know themselves...

485
01:01:00,731 --> 01:01:03,733
..as well as I know them.

486
01:01:04,335 --> 01:01:07,304
But what are you looking for here?

487
01:01:08,806 --> 01:01:11,808
What a stranger would look for.

488
01:01:12,543 --> 01:01:17,214
-Job.
That's easy. Yet...

489
01:01:17,882 --> 01:01:21,985
-What can you do?
-Anything.

490
01:01:22,086 --> 01:01:25,388
I'm a quick learner. Well...

491
01:01:25,489 --> 01:01:31,695
Great Bursa... Rich Bursa...
I'm sure it won't leave me hungry.

492
01:01:31,729 --> 01:01:33,930
It will certainly fill your stomach.

493
01:01:34,131 --> 01:01:36,099
It has fertile lands.

494
01:01:36,133 --> 01:01:41,471
God still smiles at us despite our sins.

495
01:01:41,973 --> 01:01:47,944
Silk... The greatest blessing in Bursa.

496
01:02:10,868 --> 01:02:14,204
You say silk, huh?

497
01:02:33,824 --> 01:02:36,192
The silk..

498
01:02:36,527 --> 01:02:39,529
..goes to many lands from here.

499
01:02:39,697 --> 01:02:43,566
Yes, however, it will not be like this forever.

500
01:02:48,272 --> 01:02:51,107
Why did you say that?

501
01:02:51,809 --> 01:02:54,411
Everything seems to be in order here.

502
01:02:55,379 --> 01:02:58,748
Yes, the city looks good.

503
01:02:59,483 --> 01:03:03,453
Because all the dirt goes under.

504
01:03:03,654 --> 01:03:06,890
The only thing that is not
present in Bursa is justice.

505
01:03:07,124 --> 01:03:10,093
And everyone allows it.

506
01:03:10,328 --> 01:03:14,664
Is that why you are not with the
church? You are begging around?

507
01:03:17,068 --> 01:03:21,271
If there was no justice..

508
01:03:21,339 --> 01:03:26,609
-..there would be nothing.
You said that right, stranger.

509
01:03:26,977 --> 01:03:30,547
What about Osman Bey?
What did you hear about him?

510
01:03:30,781 --> 01:03:34,384
-They say his eyes are on this place.
-Osman.

511
01:03:34,819 --> 01:03:38,088
I've heard his name before.

512
01:03:39,256 --> 01:03:43,426
Even if we do not believe in the
same religion, they say he is just.

513
01:03:46,664 --> 01:03:49,265
What about work? Where is it?

514
01:03:49,333 --> 01:03:51,801
Look, stranger. You see..

515
01:03:51,969 --> 01:03:55,605
..everyone is after their own food here.

516
01:03:55,973 --> 01:04:00,043
The merchant you passed by was hiring.

517
01:04:00,144 --> 01:04:03,813
He is our biggest supporter. Go to him.

518
01:04:04,014 --> 01:04:10,053
-He will give you a job.
-Thank you.

519
01:04:26,003 --> 01:04:27,904
Strength to your elbows, Bacis!

520
01:04:27,972 --> 01:04:32,308
-Thank you Bala Hatun.
-Welcome.

521
01:04:32,943 --> 01:04:36,413
Time goes fast, right?

522
01:04:36,580 --> 01:04:39,749
We were just a tribe of hundred tents yesterday.

523
01:04:39,817 --> 01:04:43,853
However, now we have our
banner at many cities, thank Allah.

524
01:04:43,921 --> 01:04:47,090
-Thank Allah. -However..

525
01:04:47,425 --> 01:04:51,227
..we did not just grow with
our lands and our trade.

526
01:04:51,662 --> 01:04:56,099
We grew with our houses
as well, just like our tribe.

527
01:04:57,768 --> 01:05:01,905
Now, it is time to..

528
01:05:02,139 --> 01:05:06,409
..do some work, brides.
My daughter Elcim..

529
01:05:08,612 --> 01:05:11,881
..I've heard your skills
at your tribe. That is why..

530
01:05:12,149 --> 01:05:16,252
..you will be in charge of carpet house.

531
01:05:16,821 --> 01:05:19,856
I will do what is needed, Bala Hatun.

532
01:05:19,924 --> 01:05:21,624
Thank you.

533
01:05:28,065 --> 01:05:32,202
Holofira, my daughter.

534
01:05:32,369 --> 01:05:37,273
If you accept, I have work for you as well.

535
01:05:40,244 --> 01:05:43,947
You will be in charge of non-muslim merchants..

536
01:05:44,014 --> 01:05:48,952
..who do business in our lands.
Osman Bey wants it as well.

537
01:05:58,162 --> 01:06:01,097
If I can make a difference, of course.

538
01:06:01,532 --> 01:06:04,167
Of course I will do it, Bala Hatun.

539
01:06:04,535 --> 01:06:06,936
Thank you.

540
01:06:12,309 --> 01:06:17,347
My daughter Gonca, you will..

541
01:06:17,448 --> 01:06:21,184
..be in charge of Turkmen tribes'
business, just like you were before.

542
01:06:21,585 --> 01:06:23,686
As you say, Bala Hatun.

543
01:06:30,094 --> 01:06:32,161
Fatma Hatun!

544
01:06:33,063 --> 01:06:35,231
Mother.

545
01:06:36,433 --> 01:06:40,003
About your duty.

546
01:06:40,137 --> 01:06:44,941
From now on, Fatma Hatun..

547
01:06:45,009 --> 01:06:50,513
..you are in charge of the training
of new hatuns came to Baciyans.

548
01:06:50,614 --> 01:06:53,550
Mother.

549
01:06:54,351 --> 01:06:59,088
-My dear daughter.
-As you say, mother.

550
01:07:02,293 --> 01:07:06,863
-Alright, may you do your duties well.
-Ameen.

551
01:07:07,298 --> 01:07:09,465
-Strength to your elbows.
-Thank you.

552
01:07:11,268 --> 01:07:14,370
It seems you gave up on leaving.

553
01:07:19,143 --> 01:07:21,144
Yes, for now.

554
01:07:22,913 --> 01:07:27,483
I will do the task Osman Bey gave me, Elcim Hatun.

555
01:07:28,452 --> 01:07:31,788
So you do not keep your promise.

556
01:07:32,656 --> 01:07:33,690
Elcim.

557
01:07:35,993 --> 01:07:40,063
Osman Bey and Bala Hatun gave her the duty.

558
01:07:40,965 --> 01:07:44,600
Are you questioning their decision?

559
01:07:44,768 --> 01:07:50,273
Gonca, Holofira was the one
telling she was going to leave.

560
01:07:54,712 --> 01:07:57,580
I just say what I heard from her.

561
01:07:59,149 --> 01:08:01,684
I changed my mind.

562
01:08:03,988 --> 01:08:07,823
I will be here for a while.

563
01:08:11,895 --> 01:08:15,631
I will not leave, Elcim.

564
01:08:33,751 --> 01:08:34,951
-My Gonca.
-Alaeddin.

565
01:08:34,952 --> 01:08:35,818
-My Gonca. -Alaeddin.

566
01:08:35,953 --> 01:08:39,255
My brother sent word. We are
going to Frontier Marketplace.

567
01:08:39,723 --> 01:08:44,493
I will come with you. I will not leave you alone.

568
01:09:39,416 --> 01:09:42,185
You owe us your earnings.

569
01:09:42,252 --> 01:09:45,621
-However, you are hiding the gold.
-I do not have any strength left.

570
01:09:46,023 --> 01:09:49,258
I am giving you all I have.

571
01:10:01,305 --> 01:10:03,906
Who are you?

572
01:10:08,178 --> 01:10:12,281
Who are you I said!

573
01:10:35,472 --> 01:10:39,976
I owe you. I was about to give them all I had.

574
01:10:40,043 --> 01:10:43,813
I was finished. They would've
taken it all if it wasn't for you.

575
01:10:44,448 --> 01:10:47,817
Maybe my life as well.

576
01:10:50,988 --> 01:10:56,526
-Take the half, please.
-I did not save your life for gold.

577
01:10:58,529 --> 01:11:03,099
I just did what is right. Who are they?

578
01:11:14,778 --> 01:11:18,881
Criminals who feed on merchants.

579
01:11:19,183 --> 01:11:22,151
No one says a word for their interest.

580
01:11:23,687 --> 01:11:26,689
How can I repay you?

581
01:11:27,424 --> 01:11:30,693
-I want a job.
-I am looking for a man as well.

582
01:11:31,061 --> 01:11:33,896
There is no trust left in Bursa.

583
01:11:34,064 --> 01:11:37,066
-What do you do?
-I do everything but this.

584
01:11:37,301 --> 01:11:39,535
I have a few carts of goods to be carried.

585
01:11:39,703 --> 01:11:44,740
If you put them down I will pay you for it.

586
01:11:45,175 --> 01:11:50,012
-Where do you need them put?
-That is easy, you are not from here.

587
01:11:50,247 --> 01:11:53,049
-Where do you stay?
-I do not stay at anywhere.

588
01:11:53,217 --> 01:11:55,852
Since you are my apprentice now..

589
01:11:56,053 --> 01:11:59,388
..I will take care of the place
you stay and the food you need.

590
01:11:59,489 --> 01:12:04,627
Let us go to the inn this evening.
We can eat, what do you say?

591
01:12:06,163 --> 01:12:09,465
Just tell me where do you
need your goods to be put.

592
01:12:09,867 --> 01:12:14,103
-Tell me, so that we can deserve meal.
-You haven't told me your name.

593
01:12:23,213 --> 01:12:24,247
My name.

594
01:12:26,850 --> 01:12:29,986
-..is Nicola.
And I am Hristo.

595
01:12:30,254 --> 01:12:32,255
Come on, to work.

596
01:13:02,252 --> 01:13:04,987
You've heard the guards.

597
01:13:05,322 --> 01:13:09,659
No one has seen or heard anything.

598
01:13:12,729 --> 01:13:15,531
While you were keeping us hostage in your tribe,

599
01:13:15,933 --> 01:13:20,269
Osman Bey came and questioned my alps.

600
01:13:20,971 --> 01:13:22,939
My alps don't know anything.

601
01:13:23,073 --> 01:13:25,541
Are we going to talk about the past here

602
01:13:26,410 --> 01:13:29,345
or are we going to search for truth, Yakup Bey?

603
01:13:30,414 --> 01:13:36,686
Osman Bey heard that Ulcay was there
in the Frontier Marketplace that night.

604
01:13:49,466 --> 01:13:54,170
Maybe Ulcay saw something?

605
01:13:56,106 --> 01:13:59,508
Ulcay.

606
01:14:00,243 --> 01:14:02,178
I'm a

607
01:14:06,249 --> 01:14:09,018
man of Ibrahim Bey.

608
01:14:09,886 --> 01:14:14,590
But Ahmed, Shahzade Ahmed

609
01:14:15,525 --> 01:14:18,861
was my friend.

610
01:14:21,665 --> 01:14:27,169
If I saw who killed him, would I let him live?

611
01:14:28,672 --> 01:14:34,577
Ahmed was my brother.

612
01:14:38,782 --> 01:14:42,351
People of Frontier Marketplace

613
01:14:43,387 --> 01:14:45,988
Didn't anyone see this?

614
01:14:47,290 --> 01:14:49,825
If anyone saw it

615
01:14:50,460 --> 01:14:54,864
or anyone is hiding it, show yourself.

616
01:14:54,931 --> 01:14:57,967
We'll protect his life and property.

617
01:14:58,101 --> 01:15:03,105
We just want him to speak up and reveal the truth.

618
01:15:03,306 --> 01:15:10,513
I support what Bala Hatun said. If
anyone know anything, speak up.

619
01:15:15,652 --> 01:15:19,188
I saw it.

620
01:15:22,592 --> 01:15:25,094
Come here.

621
01:15:27,697 --> 01:15:31,734
I'm Marcus, one of the Christian
merchants of Frontier Marketplace.

622
01:15:31,802 --> 01:15:36,705
Beys were so angry at each other that
I couldn't say it because I was afraid.

623
01:15:36,973 --> 01:15:39,742
So? Why are you talking now?

624
01:15:39,810 --> 01:15:44,346
A dervish named Yunus Emre calmed the Beys down.

625
01:15:44,614 --> 01:15:47,950
That's what encouraged me.

626
01:15:49,352 --> 01:15:52,822
Tell us what you saw then.

627
01:15:56,626 --> 01:16:00,329
When Alaeddin Bey and others left the tent

628
01:16:00,564 --> 01:16:03,099
someone entered the tent.

629
01:16:05,368 --> 01:16:09,171
Who entered?

630
01:16:12,109 --> 01:16:15,111
Ulcay.

631
01:16:22,185 --> 01:16:24,220
Ulcay?

632
01:16:24,287 --> 01:16:29,458
Yes, but before him, someone else entered the tent.

633
01:16:29,626 --> 01:16:33,729
-Who is he?
-He left with a bloody dagger.

634
01:16:33,930 --> 01:16:35,865
He entered before Ulcay.

635
01:16:38,201 --> 01:16:42,571
Who's that man? Who? Tell me!

636
01:16:42,672 --> 01:16:45,307
Tell me so I'll spare your life!

637
01:16:45,408 --> 01:16:48,010
Theodor. Merchant Theodor!

638
01:16:48,145 --> 01:16:54,350
Where is he? Where is he? Where is he?

639
01:16:54,618 --> 01:16:59,455
-Where is he?
-Calm down. Stop!

640
01:17:00,891 --> 01:17:04,860
Let them man speak.

641
01:17:07,531 --> 01:17:11,867
He has a house in Dargic. He must be there.

642
01:17:14,938 --> 01:17:18,941
Why would Theodor do such a thing?
What problem did he have with Ahmed Bey?

643
01:17:19,209 --> 01:17:22,811
We'll find it out from him Mehmed Bey. Come on.

644
01:17:23,580 --> 01:17:26,882
Let's go to the place he said.

645
01:18:02,619 --> 01:18:07,056
Melike Hatun.
You've seen it, right?

646
01:18:07,591 --> 01:18:10,993
The killer is not my child.

647
01:18:19,402 --> 01:18:24,406
I won't be at ease until I find the
killer and kill him with my own hands.

648
01:18:26,142 --> 01:18:29,612
-Let the truth be revealed.
-I hope you will be at ease when you see it.

649
01:18:29,713 --> 01:18:32,681
Otherwise we will have further issues.

650
01:18:44,394 --> 01:18:47,029
Yakup Bey.

651
01:18:48,832 --> 01:18:51,567
Can we talk?

652
01:19:04,180 --> 01:19:09,785
Here, get some rest.

653
01:19:15,058 --> 01:19:19,261
Where are they coming from?
-These

654
01:19:19,663 --> 01:19:24,166
come from the villages of Bursa. This is raw silk.

655
01:19:24,367 --> 01:19:28,937
We process it and make fabric.

656
01:19:32,242 --> 01:19:35,444
The value of the silk
determines the value of the fabric.

657
01:19:35,445 --> 01:19:40,816
When fine workmanship and craftsmanship
are involved, the value of silk increases

658
01:19:41,017 --> 01:19:45,587
-ten or even twenty times.
-Silk, is that so?

659
01:19:47,057 --> 01:19:50,392
So you're saying silk.

660
01:19:56,700 --> 01:20:01,737
-That's great.
-It is.

661
01:20:01,871 --> 01:20:04,707
We provide the clothes of all the kings

662
01:20:04,774 --> 01:20:08,243
lords and dukes of Europe.

663
01:20:08,611 --> 01:20:12,348
The source of richness of Bursa is silk.

664
01:20:12,782 --> 01:20:13,849
So,

665
01:20:15,251 --> 01:20:18,320
Which villages does this raw silk come from?

666
01:20:18,421 --> 01:20:21,190
St. Peter's is the best place for this.

667
01:20:21,257 --> 01:20:24,526
They also make good ones in Karlitas.

668
01:20:24,661 --> 01:20:27,863
The profit from this is good, but

669
01:20:27,931 --> 01:20:31,133
then they come to us and extort money.

670
01:20:35,972 --> 01:20:39,575
You mentioned that some stay silent

671
01:20:39,943 --> 01:20:43,512
-for their own benefits. Who are they?
-Soldiers,

672
01:20:43,646 --> 01:20:48,817
commanders, and also the Lord himself.

673
01:20:51,588 --> 01:20:54,256
Excuse me.

674
01:20:54,457 --> 01:20:56,592
Yes, ma'am. Welcome.

675
01:20:56,693 --> 01:21:00,896
Hristo's stall has the most beautiful fabrics.

676
01:21:00,964 --> 01:21:03,832
Its color is beautiful, can you open it for me?

677
01:21:06,102 --> 01:21:12,508
Oh Bursa, I've become a worker for you.

678
01:21:18,348 --> 01:21:22,451
Tell me what you have to say and then get out.

679
01:21:25,388 --> 01:21:28,457
You've heard about what happened, Yakup Bey.

680
01:21:29,192 --> 01:21:33,328
We have nothing to do with Ahmed Bey's death.

681
01:21:33,630 --> 01:21:36,665
It's not my concern.

682
01:21:37,167 --> 01:21:42,070
If you don't have anything else to say, then leave.

683
01:21:43,740 --> 01:21:46,642
Come on Alaeddin, let's leave.

684
01:21:51,614 --> 01:21:55,217
Don't, Yakup Bey. Don't.

685
01:21:55,585 --> 01:21:59,655
Put your anger and grudge aside...

686
01:21:59,989 --> 01:22:02,724
...and listen to us with your heart.

687
01:22:03,460 --> 01:22:06,929
You... you are Gonca's father.

688
01:22:10,667 --> 01:22:14,736
Have you just remembered that I was her father?

689
01:22:17,106 --> 01:22:22,344
You abducted my daughter from my tribe.

690
01:22:24,347 --> 01:22:26,782
What about you?

691
01:22:27,617 --> 01:22:31,153
You disobeyed your father's words.

692
01:22:32,922 --> 01:22:36,658
I never promised anyone anything, father.

693
01:22:37,694 --> 01:22:40,929
You never disobeyed me.

694
01:22:42,866 --> 01:22:45,501
I promised them because I trusted you.

695
01:22:48,304 --> 01:22:55,444
I trusted my daughter's
loyalty to me and to her family.

696
01:22:57,780 --> 01:23:04,219
But... it was actually rotten.

697
01:23:14,030 --> 01:23:16,899
Yakup Bey.

698
01:23:17,100 --> 01:23:21,336
Despite everything that happened...

699
01:23:22,305 --> 01:23:28,777
...I came here as Alaeddin, the
husband of your daughter, Gonca.

700
01:23:30,380 --> 01:23:36,018
I wanted to end her pain.

701
01:23:36,686 --> 01:23:41,690
So she could make peace with her father and family.

702
01:23:49,866 --> 01:23:56,405
I said my last word to your Hatun, Alaeddin.

703
01:23:59,576 --> 01:24:04,112
I don't have a daughter.

704
01:24:05,148 --> 01:24:08,150
My daughter died.

705
01:24:32,909 --> 01:24:39,014
Don't cry, my rose. Don't cry, my Gonca.

706
01:24:48,257 --> 01:24:52,260
I expected grace from you.

707
01:24:52,829 --> 01:24:57,366
But apparently... your heart is as hard as a stone.

708
01:25:03,373 --> 01:25:05,774
So be it.

709
01:25:08,511 --> 01:25:14,349
Let your mother and father turn their backs.

710
01:25:19,322 --> 01:25:25,293
I will be your family, my rose. Don't worry.

711
01:25:32,802 --> 01:25:36,171
Come on, my Gonca. Come on.

712
01:26:33,429 --> 01:26:36,531
Guests of Commander Alexius have come.

713
01:26:36,866 --> 01:26:39,768
They must've prepared a great feast.

714
01:26:45,141 --> 01:26:50,178
The guests of Commander Alexius...

715
01:26:51,380 --> 01:26:54,583
Who are they?
-They said the Lord of Mekece would come.

716
01:26:54,851 --> 01:26:57,419
And a Turk Bey.

717
01:26:59,789 --> 01:27:03,225
Turk Bey? -Yes.

718
01:27:05,361 --> 01:27:09,331
Who is that Turk Bey, huh? Let's go...

719
01:27:09,499 --> 01:27:11,900
..and see their feast.

720
01:27:12,401 --> 01:27:16,605
Go, sure. We are done anyway.

721
01:27:21,844 --> 01:27:24,513
Don't come to the inn late at night.

722
01:27:26,382 --> 01:27:29,017
You forgot your gold!
-There is no need.

723
01:27:29,352 --> 01:27:32,788
I'm not going far, you can
give it to me in the evening.

724
01:28:12,328 --> 01:28:17,132
A mother in pain..

725
01:28:21,170 --> 01:28:23,705
Which black magic...

726
01:28:23,773 --> 01:28:27,909
..can ease your heart?

727
01:28:29,545 --> 01:28:32,781
Do you know who I am?

728
01:28:37,887 --> 01:28:41,022
I can see...

729
01:28:41,524 --> 01:28:44,459
You are lost.

730
01:28:47,530 --> 01:28:50,732
You are burning with the fire of revenge.

731
01:28:51,033 --> 01:28:54,302
Your son's fiancee...

732
01:28:54,503 --> 01:29:00,709
Her Bey... You want to destroy them.

733
01:29:05,248 --> 01:29:09,417
The one who killed my son must be killed.

734
01:29:09,485 --> 01:29:11,953
I want black magic!

735
01:29:28,871 --> 01:29:33,575
I can do the magic.

736
01:29:34,543 --> 01:29:40,615
But you're after the wrong person.

737
01:29:43,252 --> 01:29:49,624
That Bey's son did not kill your son.

738
01:29:49,892 --> 01:29:54,062
Who was it then? Who? Who killed my son?

739
01:29:58,434 --> 01:30:02,203
Listen to the bell...

740
01:30:02,905 --> 01:30:07,375
...to find the murderer Melike Hatun.

741
01:30:17,954 --> 01:30:20,655
You will find him.

742
01:30:20,923 --> 01:30:25,860
Come on. Go and find him.

743
01:30:49,885 --> 01:30:52,387
Good job, old lady.

744
01:30:58,861 --> 01:31:04,833
Olcay said he would work with you in the future.

745
01:31:34,864 --> 01:31:40,402
Alps... We will split into
three and surround the house.

746
01:31:41,904 --> 01:31:45,907
Come on, in the name of Allah!

747
01:31:56,285 --> 01:31:59,854
The Righteous!

748
01:32:25,414 --> 01:32:30,819
Now! I will ask you for once.

749
01:32:31,153 --> 01:32:34,522
If you don't answer my question...

750
01:32:35,791 --> 01:32:39,828
..I will cut your heads off.

751
01:32:42,064 --> 01:32:46,101
Theodor... Where is merchant Theodor?

752
01:32:46,535 --> 01:32:50,872
He is not here.
-Where is he if he is not here?

753
01:33:02,017 --> 01:33:05,386
There, my Orhan Bey! -Theodor...

754
01:33:06,422 --> 01:33:11,059
Hasan! Take them!

755
01:33:26,375 --> 01:33:28,042
You traitor..

756
01:33:28,177 --> 01:33:34,349
You have nowhere left to run, Theodor.
We know you killed Shahzade Ahmed.

757
01:33:35,184 --> 01:33:37,886
Now..

758
01:33:40,789 --> 01:33:45,093
Now I will take you back for the court.

759
01:33:49,098 --> 01:33:51,065
Orhan...

760
01:33:52,601 --> 01:33:55,670
I won't let the man who...

761
01:33:55,738 --> 01:33:59,574
...killed my Shahzade breathe again.

762
01:34:00,009 --> 01:34:03,545
Today, I am the justice.

763
01:34:07,883 --> 01:34:09,050
Stay back.

764
01:34:10,753 --> 01:34:14,989
-Or I won't hesitate killing you.
-Orhan.

765
01:34:15,324 --> 01:34:18,693
I will kill this man today.

766
01:34:19,662 --> 01:34:23,731
No.

767
01:34:24,667 --> 01:34:28,336
I can take your life right here.

768
01:34:30,539 --> 01:34:35,610
We are trying to close this issue
and you are trying to shed blood.

769
01:34:35,744 --> 01:34:38,012
Don't.

770
01:34:39,348 --> 01:34:43,451
We will take this dog to the people.

771
01:34:43,652 --> 01:34:48,189
We will not decide what to
do with him, our Beys will.

772
01:34:49,525 --> 01:34:51,826
Alps!

773
01:34:55,497 --> 01:34:58,166
Your life has no importance..

774
01:34:58,367 --> 01:35:02,003
..to me, Ulcay.

775
01:35:04,139 --> 01:35:08,443
I can feed you to wolves, know that.

776
01:35:11,614 --> 01:35:13,181
Come on.

777
01:35:26,862 --> 01:35:32,467
Orhan Bey is dangerous,
Ulcay. He does not hesitate.

778
01:35:32,768 --> 01:35:36,137
He has sharp tooth like his father.

779
01:35:37,006 --> 01:35:41,943
However, I can tear both of their teeth apart.

780
01:37:18,707 --> 01:37:22,176
Nightmare of Turks, protector of Byzantine..

781
01:37:22,244 --> 01:37:25,413
..Lord of Mekkece, Matteos!

782
01:37:25,647 --> 01:37:29,817
Grand Bey of Turks, Candaroglu Ibrahim Bey!

783
01:37:59,248 --> 01:38:02,817
-Welcome, Beys.
-Where is he?

784
01:38:03,085 --> 01:38:06,220
Where is that murderer?

785
01:38:06,922 --> 01:38:10,591
This show is for you, Ibrahim Bey.

786
01:38:10,993 --> 01:38:14,362
First, let us enjoy it.

787
01:38:32,347 --> 01:38:35,349
I will take your plans down.

788
01:38:36,218 --> 01:38:39,921
Ibrahim Bey.

789
01:39:51,093 --> 01:39:55,296
Did he kill my Ahmed, Ulcay?

790
01:39:55,564 --> 01:39:58,165
Yes, Melike Hatun.

791
01:40:01,603 --> 01:40:05,606
If it was up to me, I would
have killed him on the road.

792
01:40:07,109 --> 01:40:09,777
However, they interrupted.

793
01:40:18,420 --> 01:40:21,088
Pick him up.

794
01:40:31,300 --> 01:40:35,503
-Did you kill him?
-Yes, I killed him!

795
01:40:41,143 --> 01:40:45,580
-Why did you kill him?
-Why did you kill him, he was my only son?

796
01:40:45,814 --> 01:40:50,585
He was my reason to breathe.

797
01:40:50,886 --> 01:40:54,422
You killed me by killing him as well.

798
01:40:56,525 --> 01:40:57,892
How did you do it?

799
01:40:58,026 --> 01:41:01,762
When I entered the caged tent..

800
01:41:01,964 --> 01:41:06,067
..he came to his senses after
seeing me. I punched him twice first.

801
01:41:06,602 --> 01:41:09,870
I told him that this here is the land of Rome.

802
01:41:10,606 --> 01:41:15,109
I took my chance of killing a Turk!

803
01:41:19,748 --> 01:41:23,050
You are just bugs who invaded these lands!

804
01:41:23,151 --> 01:41:26,387
-Is that why you killed Ahmed?
-Why did you think?

805
01:41:26,655 --> 01:41:29,590
Did that not satisfy you?

806
01:41:31,860 --> 01:41:35,463
We will kill you all. Those shiny tribes of yours..

807
01:41:35,631 --> 01:41:39,266
..your palaces, we will destroy them all!

808
01:41:40,335 --> 01:41:44,538
Look at this dog..

809
01:41:44,606 --> 01:41:46,641
..who earns in our marketplace!

810
01:41:49,745 --> 01:41:54,015
Shut it, dog! Mehmed..

811
01:41:54,383 --> 01:41:58,085
..from now on, do not let anyone
enter the marketplace you don't know.

812
01:42:00,522 --> 01:42:05,493
-What did you do after?
-I picked him up and went for his throat.

813
01:42:05,994 --> 01:42:09,630
I told him that breathing in
the holy land is forbidden.

814
01:42:09,731 --> 01:42:13,467
He resisted, wanted to live.

815
01:42:14,269 --> 01:42:19,106
I choked him and stabbed him in the chest.

816
01:42:23,412 --> 01:42:26,647
Who are you serving to?

817
01:42:28,150 --> 01:42:30,985
It does not matter anymore.

818
01:42:52,708 --> 01:42:56,043
That is how it will be.

819
01:42:59,514 --> 01:43:05,820
Those who oppress Turks will find hell.

820
01:43:12,027 --> 01:43:18,265
My Ahmed. Sleep well now.

821
01:43:18,700 --> 01:43:22,670
My son.

822
01:43:32,581 --> 01:43:37,818
-Thank Allah.
-Thank Allah, mother.

823
01:43:57,339 --> 01:44:01,108
-Hristo!
-Come on, Nicola.

824
01:44:01,743 --> 01:44:05,846
They make the best stew here.

825
01:44:09,184 --> 01:44:10,184
Come on in.

826
01:44:29,204 --> 01:44:32,973
I don't know what they are
doing with a Bey of Turks.

827
01:44:33,041 --> 01:44:36,577
They must have a reason. Or
they wouldn't be welcomed in Bursa.

828
01:44:36,645 --> 01:44:40,614
Commander Alexios is a wise man.
Must've had some tricks up his sleeve.

829
01:44:50,525 --> 01:44:53,527
-Didn't you like it, Nikola?
-Wellâ€”

830
01:44:54,229 --> 01:44:56,964
On the contrary, I loved it.

831
01:45:02,971 --> 01:45:06,373
Innkeeper! Bring whatever you have.

832
01:45:14,349 --> 01:45:16,684
Give more.

833
01:45:16,985 --> 01:45:20,120
We're Commander Aleksios' guests.

834
01:45:21,289 --> 01:45:26,126
Turkish dog is here again.
Commander Aleksios will ruin them soon.

835
01:45:26,261 --> 01:45:28,295
It won't take long.

836
01:45:44,546 --> 01:45:46,814
You're pushing my patience, commander.

837
01:45:46,982 --> 01:45:49,350
Don't dwell on this matter any longer.

838
01:45:49,451 --> 01:45:51,619
Where is my son's killer?

839
01:45:51,686 --> 01:45:57,524
Your man Ulcay... Mehmed Orhan and he already...

840
01:45:57,826 --> 01:46:00,027
...caught the killer.

841
01:46:00,428 --> 01:46:05,366
In fact, Melike Hatun killed the murderer herself.

842
01:46:08,003 --> 01:46:12,606
What are you talking about?
Are you trying to fool me?

843
01:46:16,311 --> 01:46:20,748
I already gave you the killer, Ibrahim Bey.

844
01:46:21,049 --> 01:46:24,418
How did you? How?

845
01:46:24,753 --> 01:46:28,622
How did you know what we didn't know?

846
01:46:28,924 --> 01:46:33,227
You set your eyes on Orhan's family.

847
01:46:33,495 --> 01:46:36,864
But don't forget about...

848
01:46:37,098 --> 01:46:40,267
...Rome watching you all the time.

849
01:46:40,702 --> 01:46:45,873
What? Are you not getting us watched?

850
01:46:53,782 --> 01:46:56,650
My son's killer...

851
01:46:58,453 --> 01:47:01,221
My Ahmed's killer...

852
01:47:02,324 --> 01:47:05,059
..is dead, huh?

853
01:47:06,728 --> 01:47:09,663
He's dead, huh?

854
01:47:16,404 --> 01:47:18,472
Thank Allah.

855
01:47:23,445 --> 01:47:26,480
Thank Allah.

856
01:47:28,683 --> 01:47:30,851
Well..

857
01:47:31,386 --> 01:47:33,520
Who?

858
01:47:34,222 --> 01:47:38,525
-Who planned this? -You should find it out.

859
01:47:39,227 --> 01:47:44,665
gave you what you wanted.
Now it's our turn to take.

860
01:47:47,902 --> 01:47:51,171
Let's talk about our alliance
we've been discussing.

861
01:47:54,909 --> 01:47:57,444
Go ahead.

862
01:47:58,313 --> 01:48:01,548
You'll give us your herds with a cheaper price.

863
01:48:01,683 --> 01:48:06,620
Bursa and Nikea will be
blessed with meat this year.

864
01:48:08,590 --> 01:48:12,993
We won't only have herds but also horses.

865
01:48:13,128 --> 01:48:17,231
And we'll equipped with your swords...

866
01:48:17,265 --> 01:48:20,067
...forged with fine steel.

867
01:48:20,668 --> 01:48:24,204
I already told Lord.

868
01:48:24,606 --> 01:48:27,307
Neither Yakup Bey nor I...

869
01:48:27,609 --> 01:48:32,813
...want you to be equipped with our swords.

870
01:48:34,249 --> 01:48:37,084
It's against our morals.

871
01:48:39,621 --> 01:48:42,089
Alright then.

872
01:48:42,257 --> 01:48:46,760
Osman having the wind at his
back will keep marching freely.

873
01:48:47,629 --> 01:48:50,631
And very soon he will unite...

874
01:48:50,732 --> 01:48:53,934
...all Turks under one flag.

875
01:48:54,269 --> 01:48:57,871
Will those swords and horses...

876
01:48:58,073 --> 01:49:01,642
...protect you then?

877
01:49:01,910 --> 01:49:06,780
There's hostility between you
and him. If you don't work with us,

878
01:49:07,015 --> 01:49:10,851
...Osman will be a bigger trouble for you.

879
01:49:11,486 --> 01:49:16,790
When you seal the agreement, the
silk will be sold in your markets too.

880
01:49:18,827 --> 01:49:23,730
We'll grow richer together with this trade network.

881
01:49:25,333 --> 01:49:28,936
Then nobody will be able to harm...

882
01:49:30,705 --> 01:49:33,507
...either your or me, Ibrahim Bey.

883
01:49:37,779 --> 01:49:40,347
Wrong.

884
01:49:41,816 --> 01:49:46,053
They can harm you.

885
01:49:49,591 --> 01:49:52,192
Well...

886
01:49:52,727 --> 01:49:57,431
Why are we having this alliance?

887
01:49:59,267 --> 01:50:01,869
To stop Osman.

888
01:50:02,403 --> 01:50:07,007
Good. But...

889
01:50:07,909 --> 01:50:11,145
If we can't stop him,

890
01:50:11,513 --> 01:50:16,683
...Osman will hit the heathens for sure.

891
01:50:16,751 --> 01:50:19,019
What is in your mind?

892
01:50:20,822 --> 01:50:26,660
You need to give Mekece under my command.

893
01:50:33,735 --> 01:50:39,072
If I keep the castle, Osman can't attack.

894
01:50:40,208 --> 01:50:42,242
If he does

895
01:50:42,510 --> 01:50:46,146
...no Beys will stand behind me.

896
01:50:48,449 --> 01:50:52,586
This is the only agreement
which is beneficial for us.

897
01:50:52,987 --> 01:50:56,990
Otherwise, forget about the alliance.

898
01:51:01,162 --> 01:51:03,363
That's unacceptable.

899
01:51:05,066 --> 01:51:08,068
Who says, Lord?

900
01:51:08,903 --> 01:51:12,739
Everybody should sacrifice for Rome.

901
01:51:16,744 --> 01:51:19,980
Ibrahim Bey is right.

902
01:51:21,049 --> 01:51:25,085
This is a good way to first stop Osman...

903
01:51:25,753 --> 01:51:28,455
...and then to destroy him.

904
01:51:31,726 --> 01:51:34,962
May our alliance be everlasting.

905
01:52:42,463 --> 01:52:45,332
May it be a blessing.

906
01:52:45,466 --> 01:52:49,703
Yes, Ibrahim Bey.

907
01:53:04,686 --> 01:53:11,224
-You still haven't given my gold.
-Oh, my silly mind.

908
01:53:14,462 --> 01:53:19,266
-You said there was no rush.
-There wasn't, but now there is.

909
01:53:24,372 --> 01:53:26,673
Innkeeper.

910
01:53:27,342 --> 01:53:30,444
I treat two men next to me

911
01:53:30,545 --> 01:53:33,613
to dessert and sherbet.

912
01:53:48,496 --> 01:53:51,465
This table.

913
01:54:01,609 --> 01:54:05,645
May God bless you, we're grateful.

914
01:54:07,382 --> 01:54:10,183
You're grateful to me?

915
01:54:10,451 --> 01:54:13,653
What about Commander Alexios

916
01:54:13,821 --> 01:54:17,624
-who protects all this richness?
-I don't get it?

917
01:54:19,394 --> 01:54:21,361
Those men.

918
01:54:23,030 --> 01:54:25,766
They sit in our holy table.

919
01:54:26,234 --> 01:54:29,202
Find out what's their intention.

920
01:54:29,704 --> 01:54:31,471
He's right.

921
01:54:35,777 --> 01:54:37,944
You've been working all day and sweating.

922
01:54:38,045 --> 01:54:41,014
Are you going to spend that gold for this?

923
01:54:41,082 --> 01:54:44,885
Maybe it's because I'll be repaid in kind.

924
01:54:50,391 --> 01:54:52,392
Hey, you.

925
01:54:52,994 --> 01:54:56,630
Did your Bey leave you hungry
that you're at the gates of Bursa?

926
01:54:56,697 --> 01:54:58,832
Do not bother us.

927
01:54:58,966 --> 01:55:02,068
The richness of our property
is almost equal to Bursa.

928
01:55:02,470 --> 01:55:06,807
If you were not hungry, you
would not have come to Bursa.

929
01:55:07,642 --> 01:55:10,811
Are you after our silk?

930
01:55:11,045 --> 01:55:15,949
Soon your famous silk will
be sold in our marketplace.

931
01:55:16,851 --> 01:55:20,153
Then we will get a share of your wealth.

932
01:55:20,621 --> 01:55:25,926
Now, the commander of
Bursa and our Bey are friends.

933
01:55:26,127 --> 01:55:31,565
What will you give in exchange?

934
01:55:34,902 --> 01:55:37,204
We will sell you

935
01:55:37,305 --> 01:55:40,941
Turks' glorious swords and horses.

936
01:55:41,342 --> 01:55:44,044
We will share our power with you.

937
01:55:44,245 --> 01:55:49,049
-This will strengthen our friendship.
-What are you saying?

938
01:55:49,150 --> 01:55:52,586
Do you think we need your friendship

939
01:55:52,887 --> 01:55:57,190
your swords or your horses?

940
01:56:02,463 --> 01:56:05,899
I got what I wanted.

941
01:56:25,820 --> 01:56:31,591
Thankfully, we got rid of the
slander against my brother.

942
01:56:31,792 --> 01:56:35,362
Thankfully, brother. Thankfully.

943
01:56:37,865 --> 01:56:41,401
If my father was here so we would be at ease.

944
01:56:45,306 --> 01:56:50,410
-Mother, what are you thinking about?
-This time I don't know either.

945
01:56:50,645 --> 01:56:53,513
But your father must have something in his mind.

946
01:56:53,748 --> 01:56:57,083
We will all find out when he returns.

947
01:56:59,887 --> 01:57:02,055
Come on, enjoy your food.

948
01:57:02,123 --> 01:57:02,916
Come on.

949
01:57:02,916 --> 01:57:06,776
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

950
01:57:17,605 --> 01:57:21,174
Mother. You know what?

951
01:57:21,442 --> 01:57:23,810
Since my brothers got married

952
01:57:24,111 --> 01:57:27,347
I've never had headache.

953
01:57:28,649 --> 01:57:32,052
You don't have a headache either, do you?

954
01:57:33,621 --> 01:57:36,256
A little bit.

955
01:58:26,974 --> 01:58:29,843
-Tell me.
-They're so rich, my Bey.

956
01:58:29,944 --> 01:58:33,747
They spend the money properly.
They strengthen the eastern walls.

957
01:58:33,848 --> 01:58:37,017
Our catapults can only dust the walls.

958
01:58:37,551 --> 01:58:42,422
Their soldiers are well-trained. They're
not like the ones in the castle or citadel.

959
01:58:42,490 --> 01:58:48,228
You don't say a single good word, Tugay.

960
01:58:48,462 --> 01:58:52,132
What do you think? How are people?

961
01:58:52,366 --> 01:58:57,203
My Bey, they cornered us in
the inn, we almost died there.

962
01:58:57,304 --> 01:59:03,209
People don't like us. They
will unite if there's a siege.

963
01:59:03,411 --> 01:59:07,414
So you say that it is impossible to take Bursa?

964
01:59:07,581 --> 01:59:13,620
Bursa. It is a dream for you.

965
01:59:14,922 --> 01:59:18,091
-I'll turn it into reality.
-But,

966
01:59:18,259 --> 01:59:20,960
We took my child's killer.

967
01:59:21,262 --> 01:59:24,064
Thankfully.

968
01:59:25,299 --> 01:59:28,601
Go after him!

969
01:59:35,976 --> 01:59:38,411
Commander is a smart man

970
01:59:39,313 --> 01:59:43,850
He sent him after us to find out our move.

971
01:59:47,388 --> 01:59:52,692
-Aykurt! How's the situation, Aykurt?
-My Shahzade.

972
01:59:53,627 --> 01:59:57,230
We've been working ceaselessly day and night.

973
01:59:57,364 --> 02:00:00,100
I hope it will be ready on time.

974
02:00:00,334 --> 02:00:03,470
Praise be to my brave boys.

975
02:00:03,804 --> 02:00:07,941
Praise be. They're working like bees, my Shahzade.

976
02:00:25,126 --> 02:00:27,761
-What's this, Aykurt?
-My Shahzade.

977
02:00:27,862 --> 02:00:31,631
Didn't I tell you that these jugs won't be big?

978
02:00:35,736 --> 02:00:39,572
Who told you to make them like this?

979
02:00:40,407 --> 02:00:43,743
I told them, Alaeddin Bey.

980
02:00:45,713 --> 02:00:49,249
The bigger the flying flame

981
02:00:49,383 --> 02:00:52,752
the harder the impact.

982
02:00:53,087 --> 02:00:56,656
Don't do this, Gunduz Bey. You'll
embarrass us against the enemy.

983
02:00:57,792 --> 02:01:00,760
I calculate their distances with algebra.

984
02:01:00,861 --> 02:01:05,165
If the flying flame is so big, the
catapults cannot throw them far.

985
02:01:05,299 --> 02:01:08,201
They will fall before even they get to the walls.

986
02:01:09,069 --> 02:01:11,905
-I thought that...
-Don't, Gunduz Bey.

987
02:01:12,139 --> 02:01:16,442
These require fine calculations.
Please leave it to me.

988
02:01:18,245 --> 02:01:22,448
All right, I got it, Alaeddin Bey.

989
02:01:26,287 --> 02:01:30,056
My age and experience is enough.

990
02:01:30,257 --> 02:01:33,526
You don't need to repeat anymore.

991
02:01:40,367 --> 02:01:45,505
Everyone is doing their best, Alaeddin Bey.

992
02:01:46,774 --> 02:01:49,809
There's no need to get angry.

993
02:01:50,010 --> 02:01:53,112
Elcim Hatun.. -Alaeddin.

994
02:01:57,151 --> 02:02:00,153
We're all here for this, brother.

995
02:02:00,487 --> 02:02:08,695
We will correct the mistakes.
Everyone has the same intention.

996
02:02:08,929 --> 02:02:12,365
Come on. Go and check the catapults.

997
02:02:13,133 --> 02:02:15,602
Alright, okay.

998
02:02:33,187 --> 02:02:35,922
There was no intentional mistake, Orhan.

999
02:02:36,824 --> 02:02:41,227
He who knows the elder is greater than the elder.

1000
02:02:43,163 --> 02:02:46,666
Your brother Alaeddin learned algebra,

1001
02:02:46,834 --> 02:02:50,536
it seems he didn't learn this one.

1002
02:03:00,047 --> 02:03:03,149
Ah.

1003
02:03:09,223 --> 02:03:14,060
Where are you going to run this
time? You have nowhere to go.

1004
02:03:14,662 --> 02:03:18,164
-Why are you following me?
-I don't know you, sir.

1005
02:03:18,332 --> 02:03:21,401
-I'm just a beggar.
-Where did you get these clothes?

1006
02:03:21,669 --> 02:03:24,804
A man gave me this gold coin and the clothes.

1007
02:03:24,939 --> 02:03:27,607
-He wanted me to run. -What did he look like?

1008
02:03:27,775 --> 02:03:31,377
My eyes can't see well. He
gave me gold and clothes.

1009
02:03:31,512 --> 02:03:33,613
He looks like an angel now.

1010
02:03:33,714 --> 02:03:36,683
Move. Come on.

1011
02:03:37,584 --> 02:03:41,120
-What will we tell our Bey?
-What happened. Let's go.

1012
02:03:42,990 --> 02:03:46,626
He humiliated me before all the alps.

1013
02:03:47,094 --> 02:03:49,495
Now alps...

1014
02:03:49,630 --> 02:03:53,166
..will doubt my decisions.

1015
02:03:54,268 --> 02:03:57,003
Alaaddin can't harm your authority, father.

1016
02:03:57,204 --> 02:04:02,008
How many battles did he even
fight? He'll pay for his impertinence.

1017
02:04:02,409 --> 02:04:08,481
Arrogance, daughter... Arrogance preys on minds.

1018
02:04:08,882 --> 02:04:12,819
He got acquitted. He gained Germiyan's support.

1019
02:04:13,153 --> 02:04:16,055
And now he's got arrogant.

1020
02:04:19,493 --> 02:04:22,662
But I know what to do to him.

1021
02:04:33,073 --> 02:04:36,175
How is Gunduz Bey doing, Elcim Hatun?

1022
02:04:37,611 --> 02:04:41,047
What happened upset my father, Orhan Bey.

1023
02:04:42,383 --> 02:04:46,552
But what really upset him was your attitude.

1024
02:04:48,122 --> 02:04:50,490
-Elcim...
Alaaddin..

1025
02:04:50,657 --> 02:04:53,326
...insulted my father before you.

1026
02:04:53,460 --> 02:04:56,462
Why did you let him? Why
didn't you defend my father?

1027
02:04:56,463 --> 02:05:00,099
Can the obvious be denied, Elcim Hatun?

1028
02:05:00,300 --> 02:05:04,170
Besides, my brother Alaaddin
is right about the catapults.

1029
02:05:04,171 --> 02:05:06,506
Even if he is right,

1030
02:05:06,707 --> 02:05:09,776
...he can't insult my father before everyone.

1031
02:05:29,563 --> 02:05:33,466
-Peace be upon you.
-Peace be upon you too, my Bey.

1032
02:05:33,667 --> 02:05:36,803
-Peace be upon you too.
-Peace be upon you too, my Bey.

1033
02:05:36,904 --> 02:05:38,871
Welcome, my Bey.

1034
02:05:39,006 --> 02:05:42,975
We're looking forward to hearing your news, but...

1035
02:05:43,043 --> 02:05:46,512
First, I have good news for you.
...first I have good news to give you.

1036
02:05:46,613 --> 02:05:49,015
Tell me Bala. Go ahead, Bala.

1037
02:05:52,086 --> 02:05:54,921
Shahzade Ahmed's killer was found, my Bey!

1038
02:05:55,189 --> 02:05:57,857
Alaeddin and Gonca are now free.

1039
02:05:59,793 --> 02:06:04,730
I know... I know for sure.

1040
02:06:05,732 --> 02:06:08,134
But..

1041
02:06:08,902 --> 02:06:13,706
The truth in the matter
where the infidel is involved...

1042
02:06:13,974 --> 02:06:17,043
...always makes me doubt.

1043
02:06:19,580 --> 02:06:23,583
But now, that's not our concern. Our concern is...

1044
02:06:23,884 --> 02:06:28,321
...greater and more difficult.

1045
02:06:32,025 --> 02:06:34,327
We are listening to you, Osman Bey.

1046
02:06:35,062 --> 02:06:39,732
Fitna and evilness are rising in Bursa.

1047
02:06:42,002 --> 02:06:46,339
Ibrahim Bey, the commander of Bursa and...

1048
02:06:46,507 --> 02:06:51,744
...the Lord of Mekece have become allies.

1049
02:06:54,548 --> 02:06:58,584
This darkness tries to cover the light.

1050
02:06:59,019 --> 02:07:04,090
It is a matter aimed at destroying us.

1051
02:07:08,295 --> 02:07:11,430
Our preparations are not complete. But...

1052
02:07:11,632 --> 02:07:14,300
We are ready to fight and die, Osman Bey.

1053
02:07:14,468 --> 02:07:17,803
We have no time left! We will act immediately!

1054
02:07:17,905 --> 02:07:20,940
The Alps will besiege Mekece.

1055
02:07:21,008 --> 02:07:24,177
We will go after them before this alliance...

1056
02:07:24,745 --> 02:07:27,980
...comes at us.

1057
02:07:28,182 --> 02:07:32,351
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits my Bey.

1058
02:07:38,325 --> 02:07:41,527
A war council will be planned.

1059
02:07:42,429 --> 02:07:47,967
We'll take immediate action. As soon as possible.

1060
02:07:47,968 --> 02:07:50,803
Germiyanoglu Border - Frontier Market

1061
02:07:51,171 --> 02:07:53,573
The merchants and people who withdrew from...

1062
02:07:53,674 --> 02:07:56,576
...the Karacahisar market
have now come to our market.

1063
02:07:56,710 --> 02:08:02,481
When news of the trade agreement we
made with Bursa and Mekece spreads...

1064
02:08:02,816 --> 02:08:05,351
...the market will become even richer.

1065
02:08:05,586 --> 02:08:10,423
With this agreement, I have
both found my son's murderer...

1066
02:08:10,857 --> 02:08:13,726
...and put an end to Osman's trade.

1067
02:08:13,927 --> 02:08:18,130
Soon, not even a pouch of
gold will remain in his treasury.

1068
02:08:18,498 --> 02:08:21,567
In the end, Osman will be destroyed.

1069
02:08:21,702 --> 02:08:25,304
Bursa and Iznik will be ours.

1070
02:08:26,106 --> 02:08:32,178
But first, we will defend Mekece.

1071
02:08:32,512 --> 02:08:34,847
Mehmed and Olcay...

1072
02:08:35,682 --> 02:08:39,151
...will secure Mekece.

1073
02:08:39,219 --> 02:08:41,120
My Bey...

1074
02:08:41,722 --> 02:08:45,992
Osman Bey is marching with his
Alps towards the Mekece castle.

1075
02:08:54,935 --> 02:08:58,304
Prepare the horses! We are setting out!
-Yes my Bey!

1076
02:08:58,372 --> 02:09:00,539
The day we have been waiting for has come!

1077
02:09:00,774 --> 02:09:03,576
Osman will be disgraced!

1078
02:09:03,744 --> 02:09:07,947
He will either behave or the
dark soil will be watered with blood!

1079
02:09:08,282 --> 02:09:10,216
My Bey! Where are you going?

1080
02:09:10,350 --> 02:09:15,488
To make Iznik kneel and to
make crusaders bow down, Hatun!

1081
02:09:18,892 --> 02:09:22,028
Come on.

1082
02:09:31,938 --> 02:09:35,641
Near Mekece Castle

1083
02:10:10,210 --> 02:10:12,978
Lord!

1084
02:10:13,046 --> 02:10:16,082
If you surrender...

1085
02:10:16,383 --> 02:10:18,951
...I will let you and your soldiers...

1086
02:10:19,019 --> 02:10:22,021
...to go to the closest castle.

1087
02:10:22,089 --> 02:10:25,791
What if I do not surrender?
-Then..

1088
02:10:26,193 --> 02:10:29,862
...I will destroy the walls that you trust.

1089
02:10:30,330 --> 02:10:33,632
I will kill the soldiers that you trust...

1090
02:10:34,735 --> 02:10:37,169
Now make your decision.

1091
02:10:37,571 --> 02:10:41,207
My mercy, or my furor?

1092
02:10:45,746 --> 02:10:47,947
Give me some time to think, Osman Bey.

1093
02:10:48,014 --> 02:10:53,085
I am giving you time until the sunset. Or else...

1094
02:10:55,255 --> 02:10:59,258
...the fire of cannonballs will
brighten the night, know that.

1095
02:11:02,662 --> 02:11:07,266
I don't think he will surrender, my Bey.
-He is trying to gain time, Osman Bey.

1096
02:11:07,734 --> 02:11:13,272
-So he's waiting for help from someone
-We will see.

1097
02:11:14,341 --> 02:11:18,744
We will see.

1098
02:11:28,488 --> 02:11:30,923
My soldiers!

1099
02:11:31,825 --> 02:11:37,229
The enemy has come to our walls. We
are going to protect the honor of Mekece!

1100
02:11:37,297 --> 02:11:40,332
Fight for your honor!

1101
02:11:40,867 --> 02:11:44,503
Either Osman dies today...

1102
02:11:44,604 --> 02:11:47,139
...or we will meet Jesus!

1103
02:11:47,307 --> 02:11:53,012
Death to Osman! Death to Osman!

1104
02:11:56,850 --> 02:12:00,102
The Lord hasn't said
anything, Osman Bey.

1105
02:12:00,114 --> 02:12:03,923
Then we will only hear
the sound of cannonballs.

1106
02:12:04,925 --> 02:12:08,294
They will think that we are going to attack.

1107
02:12:09,629 --> 02:12:13,566
Wait for my move. Open the doors!

1108
02:12:16,169 --> 02:12:19,538
Come on, my lions!

1109
02:12:19,940 --> 02:12:21,440
Walk!

1110
02:12:28,381 --> 02:12:32,384
Now I will teach you how you can win a war...

1111
02:12:32,886 --> 02:12:35,488
...without using your sword.

1112
02:12:35,589 --> 02:12:39,892
Alps! Prepare the flying flames!

1113
02:12:40,026 --> 02:12:42,962
Make catapults movable!

1114
02:12:43,063 --> 02:12:46,765
It's almost sunset! Come on!

1115
02:12:48,335 --> 02:12:53,205
-Praise be! My brother...
-Brother?

1116
02:12:53,573 --> 02:12:59,979
Alaeddin... Gunduz Bey is upset with
you. Why did you say those things to him?

1117
02:13:00,213 --> 02:13:04,183
-Why are you asking me why, brother?
-I am just asking you Alaeddin.

1118
02:13:04,417 --> 02:13:08,654
I just reminded him his
duty. I reported his weakness.

1119
02:13:08,655 --> 02:13:12,725
Everyone must fulfill their duties if
they do not want to hear those things.

1120
02:13:13,026 --> 02:13:16,161
Even if it is Gunduz Bey,
even if it is your father in law...

1121
02:13:16,429 --> 02:13:19,932
...I cannot ignore such mistake, brother.
-Alaeddin...

1122
02:13:20,267 --> 02:13:24,336
Of course, you are not going to
ignore it. But you know, my brother...

1123
02:13:24,404 --> 02:13:26,572
We have a way for everything.

1124
02:13:26,673 --> 02:13:31,310
You've embarrassed Gunduz
Bey in front of all the Alps.

1125
02:13:31,645 --> 02:13:35,014
Brother...

1126
02:13:39,753 --> 02:13:42,888
Calm down, Alaeddin. Calm down.

1127
02:13:48,929 --> 02:13:53,566
My Bey... The doors of the castle are open.

1128
02:13:53,967 --> 02:13:57,002
They are coming this way. They will surrender.

1129
02:13:57,270 --> 02:14:02,408
No... Don't be so sure.

1130
02:14:07,581 --> 02:14:12,618
Lords are on the way. They will
act as if they are going to surrender.

1131
02:14:12,953 --> 02:14:18,090
But... they are going there to fight.
-My Shahzade...

1132
02:14:18,625 --> 02:14:21,927
Let's see what Osman Bey is going to do now.

1133
02:14:22,062 --> 02:14:26,832
We will see, Gokmen. We will see.

1134
02:14:27,100 --> 02:14:30,302
It is time for war now. Come on!

1135
02:14:30,370 --> 02:14:33,505
Yes my Shahzade. Come on!

1136
02:14:35,241 --> 02:14:37,443
Come on!

1137
02:15:06,506 --> 02:15:09,174
Get ready!

1138
02:15:10,777 --> 02:15:14,380
Osman Bey! We did not come here to surrender...

1139
02:15:14,748 --> 02:15:19,184
-We're here to fight!
-What is he counting on?

1140
02:15:19,953 --> 02:15:24,423
I hope it's not what I think it is.

1141
02:15:26,593 --> 02:15:29,161
Come on, boys!

1142
02:15:29,262 --> 02:15:33,966
Put Ibrahim Bey's banners
and hang them over the walls.

1143
02:15:38,138 --> 02:15:42,708
Here, the victory of the jackals!

1144
02:15:55,254 --> 02:15:58,991
My Bey, someone's coming. Ibrahim Bey and

1145
02:15:59,191 --> 02:16:02,959
Yakup Bey. They're coming with their armies.

1146
02:16:04,297 --> 02:16:06,632
Do whatever you want.

1147
02:16:07,734 --> 02:16:13,539
Try anything you want, the
blood won't stop in the vein.

1148
02:16:56,483 --> 02:17:01,687
It is not enough that you two are united,
but you are also allied with the infidels?

1149
02:17:01,855 --> 02:17:04,823
It's not alliance, Osman Bey.

1150
02:17:05,424 --> 02:17:08,761
We don't form alliance with infidels.

1151
02:17:08,895 --> 02:17:12,464
-So?
Mekece Castle

1152
02:17:12,531 --> 02:17:15,768
Mekece lands

1153
02:17:15,869 --> 02:17:18,736
and Mekece's trade

1154
02:17:19,906 --> 02:17:22,941
are under my protection.

1155
02:17:25,378 --> 02:17:29,948
And Lord Mateus is now subject to me.

1156
02:17:32,652 --> 02:17:35,852
We have come to turn you from the wrong path.

1157
02:17:35,989 --> 02:17:39,324
Taking a castle that belongs to Muslims

1158
02:17:39,492 --> 02:17:42,691
is not something a Bey like you would do.

1159
02:17:42,896 --> 02:17:46,865
Osman Bey. Tell your alps,

1160
02:17:47,267 --> 02:17:52,271
let them return to their tribes.

1161
02:17:52,370 --> 02:17:55,808
So don't let them say that

1162
02:17:55,941 --> 02:17:59,709
The glorious Osman Bey was trying
to take the castle of a Muslim Bey

1163
02:17:59,813 --> 02:18:04,281
he caused the death of his alps
and, as if that were not enough

1164
02:18:05,683 --> 02:18:08,921
he lost his own life.

1165
02:18:15,459 --> 02:18:18,897
You stand between us and the infidels.

1166
02:18:19,299 --> 02:18:24,602
Taking a castle from a Muslim is unbecoming of us.

1167
02:18:29,209 --> 02:18:32,441
But keep it in mind that...

1168
02:18:32,977 --> 02:18:37,216
...taking a castle from a hypocrite
is Osman Bey's responsibility!

1169
02:18:42,692 --> 02:18:58,053
Visit turkision.com for more!